.vibedoctor/

# ---- credentials: never commit these (2026-10-05) --------------------------
# Belt AND braces. .git/info/exclude carries the same rules because it is LOCAL
# and untracked, so a bad edit to THIS file cannot un-protect the tree.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
*/.env
*/.env.*
*.token
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*_key.txt
*_secret.txt
credentials.json
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
.cookies*.json
cookies.json
.git-credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
